//! The `margin` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) shorthand property sets the
//! [margin
//! area](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Box_model/Introduction#margin_area)
//! on all four sides of an element.
//!
//! Initial: margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-top: 0. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: refer to the width of the containing block.
//!
//! Grammar: <'margin-top'>{1,4}
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-box-4/#propdef-margin
//!
//! Author guide: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/margin
